===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics}} A [[logarithmic]] [[line#Noun|line]] on a {{l|en|Gunter's scale}}, which is [[use#Verb|used]] to [[perform]] the [[multiplication]] and [[division]] of [[number#Noun|numbers]] [[mechanically]] with only [[divider]]s.
#: {{synonyms|en|Gunter's proportion|line of lines|line of numbers}}

